  "description": {
   "en": "Troubled writer Chiharu Izunome reluctantly returns to his rural hometown, hoping some R \u0026 R will refresh his creative juices. Instead of finding respite, he’s quickly entangled by an old promise to wed a local god!\n\nRin, the water dragon god to whom Chiharu has been betrothed, can be disarmingly friendly and charming, but inside lurks an animalistic ferocity. Knowing that he can’t escape Rin’s protective embrace, can Chiharu make himself fall in love with the god instead?"
  },
